# No Co-authored-by in commits

- Never add `Co-authored-by:` lines to commit messages — including Cursor, agents, or any co-author.
- Do not append attribution trailers when committing on behalf of the user.
- This repo strips all `Co-authored-by` trailers via `scripts/git-hooks/`; keep commit messages author-only.
- If rewriting history to remove trailers, use `bash scripts/strip-coauthor-trailers.sh` then `git push --force-with-lease`.
